{
 "_what": "P(the settling number lands EXACTLY on a whole line) -- the PUSH branch of a middle.",
 "_why": "A middle's window model is open at both ends, so it scores an exact landing as a miss. It is not a miss: the leg sitting on the whole number is REFUNDED while the other leg wins. Ignoring it understates every middle with a whole-number leg. On a 2.5/3 spread middle the correction is worth about 6pp of a full stake, which FLIPS THE SIGN of the EV -- so this is a correctness fix, not a refinement.",
 "_partition": "EXPLORATION ONLY (2021-2024). The 2025/2026 confirmation holdout is not read, joined, plotted or described here. GRAPH_POLICY s13.2.",
